  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=44b4a1214f0d4bcab74cfcd4cb759880",
  "detail_text": "SOURCES SOUGHT DLA Weapons Support (Columbus) is preparing to solicit a long-term contract for the NSN 2540-013859000. This announcement is considered market research in accordance with FAR Part 10. The solicitation will be synopsized separately later. The purpose of this notice is to identify qualified business concerns interested in submitting a proposal on the below listed NSN. Item details are as follows: NSN 2540-013859000 WINDSHIELD WASHER PUMP & RESERVOIR ASSY Estimated Annual Demand Quantity (ADQ) – 9,678 Unit of Issue – Each North American Industry Classification System Codes (NAICS) – 336320 NAICS Business Size – 1,000 The associated drawing number is listed below: IAW REFERENCE DRAWING NR (19207) 12342885 Sources interested in submitting a proposal on this forthcoming solicitation should complete the attached market survey questionnaire and spreadsheet and return the completed copies to Samantha Simms at samantha.simms@dla.mil by May 4th, 2026. Notice Attachments Include: 1. Market Research Questionnaire 2. Market Research NSN Spreadsheet 3. Product Item Description (PID)",
